@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-49 - Reject Return Request

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Purchases / Returns UI" as FE
control "ReturnsController" as API
control "ReturnsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: returnRequests, bills" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-49
FE -> API: PATCH /returns/:id/status
API -> Service: Execute Reject Return Request
Service -> DB: Read/write returnRequests, bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Return status = REJECTED

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Return request đang ở status PENDING
Post: Return status = REJECTED
Main flow:
1. Admin xem chi tiết
2. Admin bấm Reject
3. Admin nhập lý do reject (adminNote required)
4. System gọi API PATCH /returns/:id/status { status: REJECTED, adminNote }
5. System gửi email thông báo
end note
@enduml
